.\" Manpage for anime-dl
.TH man 1 "14 July 2022" "202606040840-git" "anime-dl"

.SH NAME
anime-dl

.SH DESCRIPTION
Search for anime to download or watch

.SH SYNOPSIS
anime-dl [options] [query]

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display the full help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Display current version.
.TP
.B \-\-config
Create user settings file.
.TP
.B \-\-options
Show all availabe options.
.TP
.B \-\-dir
Change current directory
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Output debugging information.
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Removes all formatting.
.TP
.B \-d
download episodes (the default).
.TP
.B \-q
set video quality (best|worst|720p|1080p).
.TP
.BR \-\-episode ", " \-r ", " \-a " " \fIEPISODES\fR
episode or range of episodes, for example 3 or 1\-4. \-r and \-a are older names for \-\-episode.
.TP
.B \-\-select-nth
select the nth search result.
.TP
.B \-p
download folder, overriding ANIME_DL_SAVE_DIR. Each query is saved in its own sub folder.
.TP
.B \-c
continue watching from history.
.TP
.B \-v
use VLC as the media player.
.TP
.B \-s
watch together with friends using Syncplay (mpv only).
.TP
.B \-\-nextep-countdown
show a countdown to the next episode.
.TP
.B \-\-dub
use the dubbed version.
.TP
.B \-\-skip
skip the intro (mpv only, needs ani-skip).
.TP
.BR \-\-rofi ", " \-\-dmenu
use rofi or dmenu instead of fzf.
.TP
.BR \-\-no-detach ", " \-\-exit-after-play
keep the player in the terminal.
.TP
.B \-f
ignored, fzf is the default menu.
.TP
.B \-\-update
update ani-cli from the latest release.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANIME_DL_SAVE_DIR
default download folder (default: ~/Videos/Anime).
.TP
.B ANIME_DL_SOURCE_FILE
the ani-cli script to run (default: $CASJAYSDEVDIR/sources/ani-cli, otherwise an ani-cli found in PATH). \-\-update installs it there, or into ~/.local/share/anime-dl when that is not writable.
.TP
.B ANIME_DL_UPDATE_URL
where \-\-update downloads ani-cli from (default: the latest GitHub release asset).
.TP
.B ANIME_DL_DEFAULT_OPTS
ani-cli options used when none of \-d, \-c, \-s or \-v is given (default: \-d).

.TP
.B ANIME_DL_BIN_DIR
directory yt-dlp is installed to, overriding the root/sudo detection.

.SH NOTES
anime-dl is a wrapper around ani-cli (https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli). The query is passed to ani-cli as separate arguments and is never evaluated by the shell. Downloads need yt-dlp or ffmpeg, and the menu needs fzf. A missing yt-dlp is installed from its official release (checked against the published SHA2-256SUMS) to /usr/local/bin for root or a user who can sudo, otherwise to ~/.local/bin; fzf must come from your package manager. If ani-cli reports "Blocked by cloudflare", install curl-impersonate.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B anime-dl \-\-help

.SH FILES
.TP
.I
~/.config/myscripts/anime-dl/settings.conf
.TP
.I
/usr/local/bin/anime-dl

